<title>ITALY: Snia Fibre makes prov pretax loss in 1996.</title>
<headline>Snia Fibre makes prov pretax loss in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated, provisional results)</p>
<p>    Cons turnover			1,009    vs 1,043</p>
<p>    Operating result			25    vs    22</p>
<p>    Pretax loss			     14    vs    26 loss</p>
<p>    Financial charges		     41    vs   n/a</p>
<p>    Extraordinary provisions	     3    vs   n/a</p>
<p>    Net debt				 483    vs   n/a</p>
<p>Note - Full company name is Snia Fibre Spa, which is 83.68 percent controlled by Snia Bpd, which in turn is controlled by Fiat.</p>
<p>Snia Fibre said net debt at the end of 1996 was substantially in line with that at the end of 1995 and the pretax loss came after taking into account the financial charges and provisions.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
